      "blocks": {
        "checklist": {
          "type": "custom-liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<style>.at-client-table__wrap{overflow-x:auto;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(0 0 0 / .06),0 12px 32px -18px rgb(35 61 49 / .35)}.at-client-table{inline-size:100%;min-inline-size:720px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.5;color:#4d544f}.at-client-table th,.at-client-table td{padding:12px 16px;text-align:start;vertical-align:top;border-block-end:1px solid rgb(35 61 49 / .12)}.at-client-table thead th{font-size:.6875rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#233d31}.at-client-table tbody th{font-weight:600;color:#233d31;white-space:nowrap}.at-client-table tbody tr:last-child>*{border-block-end:0}.at-client-table a{color:#233d31;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:rgb(35 61 49 / .35);text-underline-offset:.2em}.at-client-table+.at-checklist__note,.at-client-table__wrap+.at-checklist__note{margin:0}</style><div class=\"at-checklist\"><div class=\"at-checklist__intro\"><p class=\"at-checklist__eyebrow\">04 / Reorder record</p><h2 id=\"client-core-backups\" class=\"at-checklist__title at-guide-target\" tabindex=\"-1\">Keep a core and a backup for each client</h2></div><div class=\"at-client-table__wrap\"><table class=\"at-client-table\"><caption class=\"visually-hidden\">Core styles and backups for repeat orders</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Core role</th><th scope=\"col\">Default</th><th scope=\"col\">Backup</th><th scope=\"col\">Switch to the backup when&hellip;</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Core tee</th><td><a href=\"/products/gildan-5000-heavy-cotton-100-cotton-t-shirt\">Gildan 5000</a> (opening pick 01)</td><td><a href=\"/products/port-company-pc54-core-cotton-tee\">PC54</a> or <a href=\"/products/port-company-pc55-core-blend-tee\">PC55</a></td><td>The roster needs 6XL or the Port &amp; Company palette (PC54), or a cotton/poly blend or tall sizes in the same program as women&rsquo;s and youth (PC55).</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Core soft tee</th><td><a href=\"/products/gildan-64000-softstyle-t-shirt\">Gildan 64000</a></td><td><a href=\"/products/bella-canvas-3001-unisex-jersey-short-sleeve-tee\">BELLA+CANVAS 3001</a></td><td>The client asks for a retail silhouette.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Core crew</th><td><a href=\"/products/gildan-18000-heavy-blend-crewneck-sweatshirt\">Gildan 18000</a></td><td><a href=\"/products/gildan-sf000-softstyle-crewneck-sweatshirt\">Gildan SF000</a> (youth <a href=\"/products/gildan-sf000b-youth-softstyle-midweight-crewneck-sweatshirt\">SF000B</a>)</td><td>The client wants ring-spun fleece.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Core hoodie</th><td><a href=\"/products/gildan-18500-heavy-blend-hooded-sweatshirt\">Gildan 18500</a></td><td><a href=\"/products/port-company-pc78h-core-fleece-pullover-hooded-sweatshirt\">Port &amp; Company PC78H</a></td><td>Women&rsquo;s, tall or 6XL wearers are on the roster.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Core polo</th><td><a href=\"/products/sport-tek-st550-posicharge-competitor-polo\">Sport-Tek ST550</a></td><td><a href=\"/products/port-authority-k500-silk-touch-polo\">Port Authority K500</a>; youth <a href=\"/products/port-company-kp55y-youth-core-blend-jersey-knit-polo\">KP55Y</a></td><td>Women&rsquo;s need navy (LST550 has none), the roster runs tall or past 4XL, or youth sizes run short.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"at-checklist__note\">Keep the style number, color names, size chart and the approved decoration record together for each client. Recheck color and size availability before each reorder.</p></div>"
          }
        }
